# Low (tapped) ollie and a late 360 flip: still flipping when the wheels touch down, so bail.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
tap ollie 60
tap flip+up+right 92
run 400
expect event bail within 120..160
expect event comboLost within 120..160
expect no event comboLanded
expect event danger{why=mid-trick} within 110..130
